sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Patient as Patient (Browser)
    participant UI as Prescription Analysis UI
    participant Router as API Router (/api/v1/prescriptions)
    participant Pipe as PrescriptionPipeline
    participant Sanitizer as Prompt Injection Guard
    participant Extractor as pypdf / OCR Service
    participant KB as Drug Interaction KB (10 Rules)
    participant AI as Gemini 2.5 Pro / Deterministic Fallback
    participant DB as Database (prescriptions & interactions)

    Patient->>UI: Uploads prescription PDF or camera photo
    UI->>Router: POST /api/v1/prescriptions/upload (multipart)
    Router->>Pipe: validate_file_upload(file_bytes, filename)
    Pipe-->>Router: File integrity verified
    Router->>Extractor: extract_text_from_file(file_bytes)
    Extractor-->>Pipe: Raw medication text
    Pipe->>Sanitizer: sanitize_ocr_text(raw_text)
    Sanitizer-->>Pipe: Injection-safe text
    Pipe->>Pipe: extract_entities_regex(clean_text)
    Note over Pipe: Extracts: Medication name, dosage (mg), route, frequency
    Pipe->>KB: check_drug_interactions(extracted_drugs, patient_active_meds)
    Note over KB: Cross-references 10 high-risk pairs:<br/>Warfarin+Aspirin, ACE-I+Spironolactone, Metformin+Contrast...
    KB-->>Pipe: Interaction list (Severity, Rationale, Clinical Advice)
    Pipe->>AI: generate_patient_instructions(entities, interactions)
    alt Gemini Active
        AI-->>Pipe: Plain-language dosage schedule, food timing, red flags
    else Gemini Offline
        Pipe->>Pipe: generate_rule_based_medication_guidance()
    end
    Pipe->>DB: INSERT into prescription_uploads & extracted_medications
    DB-->>Pipe: Confirmed
    Pipe-->>Router: Structured prescription analysis JSON
    Router-->>UI: HTTP 200 OK
    UI-->>Patient: Displays interactive dosage card, precautions, and checklists
